        if streq(&ident, "$") { match self.peek() { Tok::Ident(_) => { ident = format!("${}", self.ident()); }, _ => {} } }   // macro metavar `$name` in a macro-BODY path/type -> ONE segment; without this `$from` read only `$`, left `from` to be re-parsed as a stray param/segment -> runaway [core-typeparse-runaway / core_simd from_transmute]
