// 5 missing `{`, 6 bad hex digit, 7 unterminated \u, 8 empty \u, 9 >6 digits, 10 > U+10FFFF, 11 surrogate,
// 12 unknown escape, 13 empty exponent, 14 bad base digits, 15 bad numeric suffix. CONTINGENT: prose messages are better diagnostics and are what D0-01 (data-form) would
