// SEM0 had no collect-into-Result case, so the generic collect built a Vec<Result<..>> and the following `?`
// read the Vec's len@0 as the Result tag (getopts$Options::parse's arg-conversion -> Err on valid args). This
// builds a real Result: iterate the map source, apply the closure per element (each -> a Result cell), push the
// Ok payload (@8) into a fresh Vec, and wrap Ok(Vec). Happy-path: the first-Err short-circuit is not modelled
