// the is_enum scan below missed it -- the scrutinee was then read as a SCALAR (its cell pointer) while the OR-alt
// test values are variant TAGS, so `ptr == 0 || ptr == 1` never held (measured: `A | B` -> matched nothing). This
// classifies the arm as enum-ish by looking THROUGH the Or to its alternatives WITHOUT changing info.kind (Or must
// stay kind 0 so s9_arm_emit_test fires only the o0 OR-eq branch, not an extra tag==testval test).
