    // these into the env, e.g. rustc_ast$TokenKind#Ident=56 AND rustc_lexer$TokenKind#Ident=4). This distinguishes
    // same-named cross-crate enums by the crate CURRENTLY being emitted: Token::ident (crate=rustc_ast) matching
    // rustc_ast::TokenKind resolves `Ident`->56 (==the lexer-built token), while the lexer's own rustc_lexer::TokenKind
    // matches (crate=rustc_parse) find no `rustc_parse$TokenKind#...` and keep their prior disc -> no regression.
