    // `res`/`n` are untouched, which self-corrects the start without a pre-scan. Each step: c = (n >= res+bit);
    // n -= (res+bit)*c; res = (res>>1) + bit*c; bit >>= 2. All 64-bit ops (values reach ~2^62). Negative
    // receivers are UB in Rust (panic); this returns garbage for them, an accepted pin.
