        // knowable: the same str/bool tests the top-level format path runs. Measured on the corpus probe
        // `tuple_debug_mixed_field_kinds`, whose third tuple is `(s, 5)` with `s: String` -- without this the
        // element printed its pointer while the three literal tuples beside it were already right.
